# Load a map's world on the world server now, between scenarios (roadmap 077, G9): the bridge
# sends LoadWorld for it as SSv2's Initialize would, as the world server's owner. A stack's
# keeper calls it on a CARLA map switch before it starts the vehicle stacks again, so they
# start on the new town and SSv2's Initialize finds it loaded (the CARLA world server does not
# reload a loaded town, so the episode stays). Refused while a scenario is running.
#
#   ros2 service call /scenario_world_bridge/load_map scensim_interfaces/srv/LoadMap
#     "{map_path: /path/to/assets/maps/Town02}"

# A map directory (its lanelet2_map.osm is used) or the lanelet2 file itself.
string map_path
---
bool success
string message
